  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nI created this recipe with an awareness of the warmth and kindness felt in everyday life. I like things to be easy, so I developed a highly versatile color recipe that can be used for any subject or scene. It's perfect for everyday snapshots, photos of food taken at coffee shops, natural scenery, and so on. It makes skin in portraits soft and beautiful.\nThis recipe is effective on bright sunny days and cloudy days, but slightly higher exposures will create the ideal look. As a recipe that suits any scene, I hope users will carry their cameras with them and use this recipe to capture the wonderful scenes they come across in their daily lives.",
